[en.FOCUS_C09_PRESERVATION_PLAN]
Sire’s Hollow Preservation Plan

[en.FOCUS_C09_PRESERVATION_PLAN_desc]
Though Firelight has agreed to share governance of Sire’s Hollow with Stellar Flare, that does not mean he agrees with her policies during her reign.\nSire’s Hollow is a beautiful little town, and that beauty should be preserved and maintained, not destroyed by Stellar Flare’s ambitions.\nDesire brews danger. Thus, within the framework of peaceful negotiation, Firelight will do his best to remove that danger.

[zh.FOCUS_C09_PRESERVATION_PLAN]
名流谷保存计划

[zh.FOCUS_C09_PRESERVATION_PLAN_desc]
虽然火光已经同意与恒星耀斑和解，共同管理名流谷，但这不代表他同意她在位期间的施政方针。\n名流谷是一个美好的小城市，这种美好应该被保存和持续下去，而不是被恒星耀斑的野心毁掉。\n欲望带来危险。因此，在和平协商的框架下，火光会尽力去除这种危险。
